    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>193</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>96500</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br />So No. of moles of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> oxidized by 1 moles of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
